ZEHRA KE BAIN THE YE PAYAMBER UTHO UTHO<br>
DEEN-E-KHUDA KE HADI-O-RAHBER UTHO UTHO<br>
<br>
Baba tumhari yaad mein tukde jigar hai aaj<br>
Dil beqaraar hai mera dumbhar utho utho<br>
<br>
Bechain dil hai paas bula lijiye mujhe <br>
Ab zeest meri hogayi doobhar utho utho<br>
<br>
Hasnain roke kehte hain nana kaha gaye <br>
Bachcho ko mai manau to kyunkar utho utho<br>
<br>
Zainab pachhade khaati hain Kulsoom rothi hain<br>
Furqat mein sab hain apki muztar utho utho<br>
<br>
Qabr-e-Rasool-e-Pak pe Zehra ke the ye bain <br>
Rone nahi ye dete sitamgar utho utho<br>
<br>
Pehlu mera shikasta kiya ghar jala diya <br>
Jaaun kahan mai bachcho ko lekar utho utho<br>
<br>
Ghurbat me sar se Saaya-e-Rehmath jo uth gaya <br>
Qasim bhi keh raha hai ye rokar utho utho
